@* Under a choice of team (a hand-off, a split's part, the editor's team, an external action's card): says when an
   external team won't be emailed its reminders, and why, so work isn't handed to someone who never hears of it.
   Nothing for an internal team, or one that will be emailed. *@
@inject Tide.Application.Actions.TeamService TeamSvc

@if (Team is not null && TeamSvc.NotEmailedWhy(Team) is { } why)
{
    <div class="tide-missing small mt-2" role="status"><span class="bi bi-envelope-slash" aria-hidden="true"></span> @why</div>
}

@code {
    [Parameter] public Tide.Domain.Entities.Team? Team { get; set; }
}
